        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>资金同业业务 - 银行业务关键指标</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimHei\", sans-serif;\n    color: #222;\n    position: relative;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 40px 60px 60px 60px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  .side-tab {\n    position: fixed;\n    top: 380px;\n    right: 0;\n    background-color: #e8631a;\n    color: #fff;\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    padding: 20px 8px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    border-radius: 8px 0 0 8px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  h2.section-title {\n    color: #1a7a52;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n    margin-top: 30px;\n  }\n  p.intro {\n    margin: 0 0 25px 0;\n    font-size: 14.5px;\n  }\n  .icon-block {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .icon-label {\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    color: #e8631a;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n    margin-right: 15px;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    width: 90px;\n    height: 90px;\n    border: 1px dashed #e8631a;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #e8631a;\n    margin-right: 20px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    padding: 4px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .icon-text {\n    flex: 1;\n    padding-top: 5px;\n    font-size: 14.5px;\n  }\n  .dotted-divider {\n    border: none;\n    border-top: 1px dotted #ccc;\n    margin: 15px 0 15px 130px;\n  }\n  h2.table-title {\n    color: #1a7a52;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    margin-top: 40px;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n  }\n  table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n  table th, table td {\n    padding: 8px 4px;\n    text-align: right;\n  }\n  table td:first-child, table th:first-child {\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n  .header-row th {\n    color: #666;\n    font-weight: normal;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #999;\n    padding-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .header-row th.highlight-year {\n    color: #1a7a52;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .header-row th:first-child {\n    color: #999;\n  }\n  .section-label td {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    padding-top: 15px;\n  }\n  td.bold-num {\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .indent1 {\n    padding-left: 20px;\n  }\n  .indent2 {\n    padding-left: 40px;\n  }\n  .last-row td {\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #e8631a;\n    padding-bottom: 12px;\n  }\n  .notes {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #444;\n    margin-top: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n  }\n  .footer {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-top: 40px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    padding-top: 10px;\n  }\n  .footer .left {\n    color: #e8631a;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .footer .right {\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .footer .pagenum {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-left: 15px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"side-tab\">经营情况讨论及分析</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">资金同业业务</h2>\n<p class=\"intro\">平安银行资金同业业务通过\"投资交易+客户业务\"双轮驱动，持续提升投资、交易和销售三大能力，助力金融市场高质量发展。</p>\n\n<div class=\"icon-block\">\n  <div class=\"icon-label\">投资交易</div>\n  <div class=\"placeholder\">[Icon: 投资交易图标 - 文档与货币符号]</div>\n  <div class=\"icon-text\">\n    平安银行加强宏观分析研判，在保障资产端的流动性与安全性前提下，优化交易策略，合理配置持仓组合，保持稳健投资。2024年，平安银行债券交易量的市场份额为4.4%，同比上升1.2个百分点。\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<hr class=\"dotted-divider\">\n\n<div class=\"icon-block\">\n  <div class=\"icon-label\">客户业务</div>\n  <div class=\"placeholder\">[Icon: 客户业务图标 - 人物与对勾]</div>\n  <div class=\"icon-text\">\n    平安银行依托客户综合服务优势，在做市、避险、机构销售、托管等多领域积极发力。2024年，平安银行境内外机构销售的现券交易量4.54万亿元，同比增长46.0%；在平安银行办理外汇即期及衍生品避险业务的客户达14,987户，同比增长16.5%；截至2024年12月31日，通过\"行e通\"平台销售的资管产品保有规模2,667.05亿元，较年初增长33.2%；托管净值规模达9.10万亿元，较年初增长4.6%。\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"table-title\">银行业务关键指标</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <tr class=\"header-row\">\n    <th>（人民币百万元）</th>\n    <th class=\"highlight-year\">2024年</th>\n    <th>2023年</th>\n    <th>变动(%)</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr class=\"section-label\">\n    <td colspan=\"4\">经营成果</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>营业收入</td>\n    <td class=\"bold-num\">146,695</td>\n    <td>164,699</td>\n    <td>（10.9）</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>净利润</td>\n    <td class=\"bold-num\">44,508</td>\n    <td>46,455</td>\n    <td>（4.2）</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>成本收入比(%)</td>\n    <td class=\"bold-num\">27.66</td>\n    <td>27.90</td>\n    <td>下降0.24个百分点</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>平均总资产收益率(%)</td>\n    <td class=\"bold-num\">0.78</td>\n    <td>0.85</td>\n    <td>下降0.07个百分点</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>加权平均净资产收益率(%)</td>\n    <td class=\"bold-num\">10.08</td>\n    <td>11.38</td>\n    <td>下降1.30个百分点</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr class=\"last-row\">\n    <td>净息差(%)</td>\n    <td class=\"bold-num\">1.87</td>\n    <td>2.38</td>\n    <td>下降0.51个百分点</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<table style=\"margin-top:25px;\">\n  <tr class=\"header-row\">\n    <th>（人民币百万元）</th>\n    <th class=\"highlight-year\">2024年12月31日</th>\n    <th>2023年12月31日</th>\n    <th>变动</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr class=\"section-label\">\n    <td colspan=\"4\">存贷款业务<sup>(1)</sup></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>吸收存款</td>\n    <td class=\"bold-num\">3,533,678</td>\n    <td>3,407,295</td>\n    <td>3.7%</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"indent1\">其中：个人存款</td>\n    <td class=\"bold-num\">1,287,180</td>\n    <td>1,207,618</td>\n    <td>6.6%</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"indent2\">企业存款</td>\n    <td class=\"bold-num\">2,246,498</td>\n    <td>2,199,677</td>\n    <td>2.1%</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>发放贷款和垫款总额</td>\n    <td class=\"bold-num\">3,374,103</td>\n    <td>3,407,509</td>\n    <td>（1.0%）</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"indent1\">其中：个人贷款</td>\n    <td class=\"bold-num\">1,767,168</td>\n    <td>1,977,719</td>\n    <td>（10.6%）</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"indent2\">企业贷款</td>\n    <td class=\"bold-num\">1,606,935</td>\n    <td>1,429,790</td>\n    <td>12.4%</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr class=\"section-label\">\n    <td colspan=\"4\">资产质量</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>不良贷款率(%)</td>\n    <td class=\"bold-num\">1.06</td>\n    <td>1.06</td>\n    <td>–</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>拨备覆盖率(%)</td>\n    <td class=\"bold-num\">250.71</td>\n    <td>277.63</td>\n    <td>下降26.92个百分点</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>逾期60天以上贷款偏离度<sup>(2)</sup></td>\n    <td class=\"bold-num\">0.80</td>\n    <td>0.74</td>\n    <td>上升0.06</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr class=\"section-label\">\n    <td colspan=\"4\">资本充足率</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr class=\"last-row\">\n    <td>核心一级资本充足率<sup>(3)</sup>(%)</td>\n    <td class=\"bold-num\">9.12</td>\n    <td>9.22</td>\n    <td>下降0.10个百分点</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<div class=\"notes\">\n  注：（1）吸收存款、发放贷款和垫款总额及其明细项目均为不含息金额。<br>\n  （2）逾期60天以上贷款偏离度＝逾期60天以上贷款余额／不良贷款余额。<br>\n  （3）核心一级资本充足率的最低监管要求为7.75%。\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"footer\">\n  <div class=\"left\">二零二四年年报</div>\n  <div class=\"right\">中国平安保险（集团）股份有限公司 <span class=\"pagenum\">51</span></div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
